WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:08.568
"Home, at last!" Ally smiled and looked out the window.

2
00:00:08.569 --> 00:00:16.326
After a long, twelve-hour flight from Patagonia, Lainie Polk's private jet had touched down at Sandville Airport.

3
00:00:16.327 --> 00:00:20.575
Ally couldn't wait to see Mateo and tell him that their plan had worked.

4
00:00:20.576 --> 00:00:26.761
During the solar eclipse in Patagonia, Ally's Astralian powers had come back!

5
00:00:26.762 --> 00:00:29.895
"What a relief," she thought.

6
00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:35.489
A crew member lowered the jet's stairs.

7
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:39.296
"Thanks for everything," Ally said as she left the plane.

8
00:00:39.297 --> 00:00:47.529
"This jet is much nicer than my family's ship—uh, I mean, car!"

9
00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:50.423
"Yikes." Ally slapped her forehead.

10
00:00:50.424 --> 00:00:59.081
"I'm so excited to have my powers back, I almost forgot that I'm still on Earth."

11
00:00:59.082 --> 00:01:03.228
Inside the airport, Ally looked around.

12
00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:07.712
"Hmm. Where do I get the bus to downtown?" she thought.

13
00:01:07.713 --> 00:01:11.402
Transportation always seemed so complicated on Earth.

14
00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:21.621
Back on Astralia, everyone had their own spaceships.

15
00:01:21.622 --> 00:01:28.401
Finally Ally saw a sign for the downtown bus.

16
00:01:28.402 --> 00:01:32.601
She was heading toward it when she spotted someone familiar.

17
00:01:32.602 --> 00:01:37.982
"Mateo! What's he doing here?" Ally giggled.

18
00:01:37.983 --> 00:01:41.478
"I'm not going to tell him I got my powers back.

19
00:01:41.479 --> 00:01:43.833
I'm going to show him!"

20
00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:48.748
Ally sneaked up behind a potted plant and threw her voice in Mateo's direction.

21
00:01:48.749 --> 00:01:51.420
"Mateo! Is that you?"

22
00:01:51.421 --> 00:01:56.141
Mateo spun around. "Huh?"

23
00:01:56.142 --> 00:02:00.777
Ally threw her voice in another direction. "Over here!"

24
00:02:00.778 --> 00:02:06.741
While Mateo spun around and around looking for her, Ally stepped up behind him. "Boo!"

25
00:02:06.742 --> 00:02:09.512
"Ahh!" Mateo jumped.

26
00:02:09.513 --> 00:02:11.840
"Ally! You scared me!"

27
00:02:11.841 --> 00:02:14.641
"Sorry!" Ally grinned.

28
00:02:14.642 --> 00:02:18.935
"I wanted to show you that I got my powers back."

29
00:02:18.936 --> 00:02:25.266
"That's great news, but . . ." Mateo's expression was serious—very serious.

30
00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:27.883
"We've got another big problem.

31
00:02:27.884 --> 00:02:30.636
That's why I'm here to meet you."

32
00:02:30.637 --> 00:02:35.092
Ally's heart sunk. "Did something happen at the diner?"

33
00:02:35.093 --> 00:02:40.998
"I'll tell you about it on the way home. Come on, let's go."

34
00:02:40.999 --> 00:02:48.397
Mateo was leading Ally toward the bus stop when she spotted another familiar face. "Is that Tina?"

35
00:02:48.398 --> 00:02:54.053
"I think so," Mateo said, " but we have to hurry. Our bus arrives in—"

36
00:02:54.054 --> 00:02:58.638
"Look, she's waving at us." Ally waved back.

37
00:02:58.639 --> 00:03:02.728
"It would be rude not to say hello. I'll be right back."

38
00:03:02.729 --> 00:03:05.176
Ally ran over.

39
00:03:05.177 --> 00:03:11.328
"Hi, Tina. You're not leaving town already, are you? You just got here."

40
00:03:11.329 --> 00:03:14.177
"Uh, no . . ." Tina hesitated.

41
00:03:14.178 --> 00:03:18.865
"I'm just here to pick up a package for the museum." "Cool,"

42
00:03:18.866 --> 00:03:20.834
Ally said. "Well,

43
00:03:20.835 --> 00:03:25.153
I've got to get the bus. See you soon at the diner!" "Nice

44
00:03:25.154 --> 00:03:30.076
to, um, bump into you," Tina said. Mateo

45
00:03:30.077 --> 00:03:33.275
grabbed Ally's arm. "Ally. We have to—" "Ally,

46
00:03:33.276 --> 00:03:38.638
Mateo! What are you doing here?" Barry hurried over. "Did

47
00:03:38.639 --> 00:03:41.127
you come to see me off?" "Wow!"

48
00:03:41.128 --> 00:03:44.226
Ally was amazed. "Everyone

49
00:03:44.227 --> 00:03:48.273
is here today. Where are you going, Barry?" "My

50
00:03:48.274 --> 00:03:51.076
dad is taking me to Italy," Barry said. "I

51
00:03:51.077 --> 00:03:53.687
can't wait to taste all the delicious food! Oops,

52
00:03:53.688 --> 00:03:56.250
my flight is boarding now. Gotta go!" "Have

53
00:03:56.251 --> 00:04:00.247
fun!" Ally waved good-bye. "Ally,

54
00:04:00.248 --> 00:04:04.339
our bus!" Mateo said. "Run!" Ally

55
00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.351
and Mateo raced to the bus. Once

56
00:04:07.352 --> 00:04:13.338
they were onboard, Mateo chose two seats in the far back, away from other passengers. He

57
00:04:13.339 --> 00:04:17.170
kept his voice low. "Here's the bad news. Alpha

58
00:04:17.171 --> 00:04:20.985
detected an alien life-form in Sandville." "Oh,

59
00:04:20.986 --> 00:04:26.750
I know about that already." Ally shrugged. "It's just a rock." Mateo

60
00:04:26.751 --> 00:04:31.615
shook his head. "This is not a rock. It's

61
00:04:31.616 --> 00:04:37.838
a Jorgandian life-form. Alpha is certain of it." "What?

62
00:04:37.839 --> 00:04:43.274
A Jorgandian is here in Sandville?" Ally gripped his arm. "Jorgandians

63
00:04:43.275 --> 00:04:46.925
have vowed to destroy Astralia! And

64
00:04:46.926 --> 00:04:50.648
if there's one in Sandville, it might be able to detect me. No

65
00:04:50.649 --> 00:04:52.771
wonder you came to get me! This

66
00:04:52.772 --> 00:04:58.675
is bad . . . really, really bad!" ***

67
00:04:58.676 --> 00:05:04.749
As soon as Ally and Mateo got home, Ally turned Alpha on.

68
00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:09.593
"Alpha, are you certain you detected a Jorgandian in Sandville?"

69
00:05:09.594 --> 00:05:14.749
"Affirmative. Repeated scans have picked up a Jorgandian life-form."

70
00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.924
"Where is it?" Ally asked. "And when did it arrive?"

71
00:05:18.925 --> 00:05:25.822
Alpha sounded frustrated. "Without my original components, I am unable to pinpoint its exact location.

72
00:05:25.823 --> 00:05:30.106
I can, however, estimate it has been here a few weeks."

73
00:05:30.107 --> 00:05:33.427
Mateo frowned. "That's not very helpful.

74
00:05:33.428 --> 00:05:39.372
This is a big town. Plus, it's summertime, so there are lots of tourists here.

75
00:05:39.373 --> 00:05:43.331
You saw how crowded the airport was today, Ally."

76
00:05:43.332 --> 00:05:50.838
Alpha's screen flashed. "It is imperative you find the Jorgandian before it finds you, Allyzooba."

77
00:05:50.839 --> 00:05:56.154
"Why? It wouldn't try to hurt her, would it?" Mateo asked.

78
00:05:56.155 --> 00:06:00.192
Ally bit her lip, waiting anxiously for the reply.

79
00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:03.672
"'Hurt' is not the correct term," Alpha said.

80
00:06:03.673 --> 00:06:10.923
"Allyzooba, the Jorgandian will attempt to evaporate you."

